o)\r\nundefined symbol: _ZN9grpc_impl13ServerBuilderD1Ev\t(./libmavsdk_server.so)\r\nundefined symbol: _ZN9grpc_impl13ServerBuilderC1Ev\t(./libmavsdk_server.so)\r\nundefined symbol: _ZN9grpc_impl13ServerBuilder13BuildAndStartEv\t(./libmavsdk_server.so)\r\nundefined symbol: _ZN9grpc_impl13ServerBuilder16AddListeningPortERKNSt7__cxx1112basic_stringIcSt11char_traitsIcESaIcEEESt10shared_ptrINS_17ServerCredentialsEEPi\t(./libmavsdk_server.so)\r\nundefined symbol: _ZN9grpc_impl13ServerBuilder15RegisterServiceEPN4grpc7ServiceE\t(./libmavsdk_server.so)\r\nundefined symbol: _ZN9grpc_impl25InsecureServerCredentialsEv\t(./libmavsdk_server.so)\r\n```\r\n\r\nIs there a cmake switch to install the dep libraries?", "closed_by": {"login": "fnoop", "id": 8210968, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjgyMTA5Njg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8210968?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop", "html_url": "https://github.com/fnoop", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/936/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/936/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "complet